      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{69cfaca66c6843887a858a13|full_name} I've reproduced this.\n\nAssuming there's no \"Sign-in to confirm you're not a bot\" error in the logs and you're not seeing that message in an incognito browser window when opening your YouTube URL, you're most likely affected by https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/issues/17456, described in https://ask.vrchat.com/t/video-players-completely-broken/48829/2. VRChat can fix this with a yt-dlp update (with a patch to disable `visionos` in the new version).\n\nResolvable by: [Update to yt-dlp 2026.08.19](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/update-to-yt-dlp-20260819) (feature request)\n\nDuplicate bug report of: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/video-bug\n\nThank you for your bug report.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
